Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Nave Danan <nave0712@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-cryptography, libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, xclip, wl-clipboard, xdg-desktop-portal (>= 1.18), dbus-user-session, xdotool, pkexec
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome (>= 46)
Homepage: https://github.com/NaveDanan/Mouse-Without-Borders-for-Linux
Description: Mouse Without Borders Linux companion
 Connect Debian-based Linux and Windows PCs through the Mouse Without Borders
 protocol and share keyboard, pointer, text/PNG clipboard data, encrypted file
 drag-and-drop, and shortcuts. Wayland input uses rootless desktop portals and
 the EIS protocol.
